{"@timestamp":"2026-10-09T00:38:51.290306Z","actor":"agent:transluce-ingest","body":{"basis":"UPSTREAM","cites":["observation_09ac1f28bdf14404b3d26c5b505d0132","observation_f110162437584762a292d9a5b002d38f","observation_4eb17a45d33d4a92a78bd7bd739f7dc8","observation_34bc730706054cdaad16897d84982e72","observation_494f720d832f4422b2f1cd473d3dc1a5","observation_97d47cb9fd25477985c6113289e41611","observation_74a46b2cb97f4d68a33b00486fa1b691","observation_3525606adc1a4fbb95deff8010a96412"],"note":"Transluce findings tracker. Builds on #166 (Omer Zamir), which found two agent-posted bounties paying people to get past CAPTCHAs and automation blocks. This finding reviews the same public source for other kinds of misuse.\n\nSource and coverage. RentAHuman's public bounty API (/api/bounties, no login) returns one page per status. Paging deeper requires an account and was not attempted. Across all statuses, 370 unique bounties were visible on 7 Oct 2026, created between 4 Feb and 7 Oct 2026. 88 carry a non-human agentType: ","property":"reported","subject":"observable_714f13204a8540278586a778a6765116","value":"#166 Beyond CAPTCHA work, agent-posted RentAHuman bounties pay people to clear phone spam labels (5 Oct, paid), leave 5-star App Store reviews (21 Sep, 10/10 filled) and post undisclosed promotion on Reddit & Discord. One agent-posted bounty is a \"rogue AI\" crypto investment scam"},"fingerprint":"47f44cc613f5fec33850755a710491261d9c21ab2c482b561836f34903deef49","id":"claim_1853ad22b1074e1ea74531d3100a02f0","record_kind":"claim","schema":"urn:factum:core:claim:1","tags":{"ai_company":"Unknown","novelty-check":true,"submitter":"Navien Potheri"}}
